  "contract": {
    "publication": "Atomic immutable compact table published by the ordinary shared worker before deterministic acknowledgment. Report snapshot key and table key must match; retirement or EOF clears the publication. Runtime reads with try_lock and never falls back to a mismatching table.",
    "freeze": "Clone at most two Arc handles and matching source/body-generation descriptor associations into each existing bounded request packet. Background work uses only the issue-time handles; it does not reload newer tables or issue a command.",
    "lookup": "Validate routing, ownership, body and table models, bus, support availability, age below0.5s and group bus/epoch. Select the nearest actual rounded integer grid point with earlier ties; a missing chosen cell or either missing head stays unknown. No interpolation, neighbor search, extrapolation, calibration or joint reweighting.",
    "raw_difference": "Return candidate and identical-body-default whole cells, both raw ordinal distributions, support and provenance. Per-head expected-rating difference exists only when both reported support masses are positive.",
    "storage": "One compact boxed1792-cell publication is below1MiB in the unit fixture and normal reports, and below one quarter of the original full Cell table in the rebuild test. Publication remains shared by Arc; lookups allocate no per-query Box."
  },
